Include this license and preserve applicable copyright and third-party
notices in copies and distributions, including binary distributions.
Distribute covered modifications under this exact license and do not
impose additional restrictions on recipients' exercise of its permissions.
No trademark rights are granted.

6. Termination and disclaimer

Your permissions terminate automatically upon breach. On your first breach
they are reinstated if you fully cure it within 30 calendar days after you
learn of it. Termination does not terminate the permissions of recipients
who comply independently. Publication obligations for modifications already
made survive termination.

